<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   42.50		 42.55</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	71.55		 71.65</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 27.70		 27.75</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.374		 0.376</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.32		 11.34</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.58		 11.60</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.14		  1.16</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 6.15 pct	    6.35 pct</p>
</text>
